#: ../../../index.md:76
msgid "About"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../index.md:1
msgid "xlwings - Make Excel Fly!"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../index.md:3
msgid ""
"xlwings (Open Source) is a [BSD-licensed](http://opensource.org/licenses/"
"BSD-3-Clause) Python library that makes it easy to call Python from Excel "
"and vice versa:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../index.md:5
msgid ""
"**Scripting**: Automate/interact with Excel from Python using a syntax close "
"to VBA."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../index.md:6
msgid "**Macros**: Replace VBA macros with clean and powerful Python code."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../index.md:7
msgid "**UDFs**: Write User Defined Functions (UDFs) in Python (Windows only)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../index.md:9
msgid ""
"**Numpy arrays** and **Pandas Series/DataFrames** are fully supported. "
"xlwings-powered workbooks are easy to distribute and work on **Windows** and "
"**Mac**."
msgstr ""

